<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CPT Stuck Point Log - Interactive Worksheet</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com/3.4.17"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: 'class',
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#f0f7ff',
              100: '#e0effe',
              200: '#bae0fd',
              500: '#0284c7',
              600: '#0369a1',
              700: '#075985',
              800: '#0c4a6e',
              900: '#082f49'
            },
            tealbrand: {
              50: '#f0fdfa',
              100: '#ccfbf1',
              500: '#14b8a6',
              600: '#0d9488',
              700: '#0f766e'
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    @media print {
      body {
        background-color: white !important;
        color: black !important;
        font-size: 11pt !important;
      }
      .no-print {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .print-only {
        display: block !important;
      }
      .page-break {
        page-break-after: always;
      }
      .shadow-sm, .shadow, .shadow-md, .shadow-lg {
        box-shadow: none !important;
      }
      .border {
        border-color: #cbd5e1 !important;
      }
      table {
        width: 100% !important;
        border-collapse: collapse !important;
      }
      th, td {
        border: 1px solid #94a3b8 !important;
        padding: 6px 8px !important;
      }
      th {
        background-color: #f1f5f9 !important;
        color: #0f172a !important;
      }
    }
    .print-only {
      display: none;
    }
    .crossed-off {
      text-decoration: line-through;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen font-sans antialiased selection:bg-brand-500 selection:text-white">

  <!-- Notification Toast Container -->
  <div id="toastContainer" class="fixed top-4 right-4 z-50 flex flex-col gap-2 pointer-events-none no-print"></div>

  <!-- In-page Modal Overlay -->
  <div id="modalOverlay" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 no-print">
    <div id="modalCard" class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 transform transition-all">
      <h3 id="modalTitle" class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Notice</h3>
      <p id="modalBody" class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6"></p>
      <div id="modalActions" class="flex justify-end gap-3">
        <!-- Injected dynamically -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Educational Reference Modal -->
  <div id="guideModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 no-print overflow-y-auto">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
      <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-700 to-tealbrand-700 text-white flex justify-between items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">CPT Stuck Point Reference Guide</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-100">Cognitive Processing Therapy (Resick, Monson, & Chard)</p>
        </div>
        <button id="closeGuideBtn" class="text-white/80 hover:text-white text-2xl font-bold leading-none">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-800 text-base mb-1">1. What is a "Stuck Point"?</h3>
          <p class="mb-2">A Stuck Point is a concise, declarative belief or thought formed during or after a trauma that keeps you stuck in PTSD symptoms, guilt, shame, fear, or helplessness. It is <strong>NOT</strong> a feeling, and <strong>NOT</strong> a pure objective fact.</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-xs">
            <div class="p-2 bg-red-50 text-red-900 rounded border border-red-200">
              <span class="font-bold block">❌ Feeling (Not a Stuck Point):</span>
              "I feel terrified and disgusted."
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 rounded border border-amber-200">
              <span class="font-bold block">⚠️ Objective Fact (Not a Stuck Point):</span>
              "The assault occurred at 11 PM."
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 rounded border border-emerald-200">
              <span class="font-bold block">✅ Stuck Point (Belief Statement):</span>
              "Because I stayed out late, it is entirely my fault."
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-800 text-base mb-1">2. The 5 Core CPT Themes</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>Safety:</strong> Beliefs about harm, protection, vulnerability, and danger (e.g., <em>"Nowhere is safe," "I cannot protect my family."</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Trust:</strong> Beliefs about relying on one's own judgment or trusting others (e.g., <em>"People are deceitful," "I can never trust my instincts."</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Power / Control:</strong> Beliefs about agency, influence, and helplessness (e.g., <em>"I must control everything," "I have zero control over my life."</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Esteem:</strong> Beliefs about self-worth, respect, being damaged, or viewing humanity cynically (e.g., <em>"I am permanently broken," "I am unlovable."</em>).</li>
            <li><strong>Intimacy:</strong> Beliefs about emotional closeness, vulnerability, and connection (e.g., <em>"If I get close to someone, they will hurt me."</em>).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-800 text-base mb-1">3. Types of Belief Disruption</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200">
              <strong class="text-blue-900 block text-sm mb-1">Assimilation (Self-Blame & Hindsight)</strong>
              The trauma is forced into prior beliefs. Often sounds like <em>"If only I had..."</em> or <em>"I should have known..."</em>. Causes unwarranted guilt, remorse, and hindsight bias.
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-purple-50 rounded-lg border border-purple-200">
              <strong class="text-purple-900 block text-sm mb-1">Over-Accommodation (Extreme Shift)</strong>
              Beliefs about the world or self shift to an extreme absolute. Words like <em>"always," "never," "everyone," "nobody"</em> (e.g., <em>"You can't trust anyone"</em>).
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-800 text-base mb-1">4. Crossing Off Stuck Points in CPT</h3>
          <p>As you work through CPT worksheets (Challenging Questions, Patterns of Problematic Thinking, Alternative Thoughts), you will develop <strong>Accommodated Thoughts</strong> (balanced, realistic beliefs). When your belief in the original stuck point drops significantly, you celebrate recovery by <strong>crossing it off</strong> your log!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100 border-t border-slate-200 flex justify-end">
        <button id="closeGuideBottomBtn" class="px-4 py-2 bg-brand-700 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-brand-800 transition">Close Guide</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-800 via-brand-700 to-tealbrand-700 text-white shadow-md">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-5">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Cognitive Processing Therapy</span>
            <span class="bg-tealbrand-500/30 text-teal-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-medium">Evidence-Based PTSD Tool</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-1">Stuck Point Log</h1>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-100 mt-1 max-w-2xl">
            Track, examine, and resolve trauma-related beliefs. In CPT, keep this log at the front of your therapy binder and cross off thoughts as your beliefs heal.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Quick Action Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 no-print">
          <button id="openGuideBtn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-lg backdrop-blur transition border border-white/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            CPT Guide
          </button>
          <button id="loadSamplesBtn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-lg backdrop-blur transition border border-white/20">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
            Load Examples
          </button>
          <button id="printBtn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 bg-tealbrand-600 hover:bg-tealbrand-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg shadow transition">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 17h2a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h6a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2zm8-12V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4h10z"/></svg>
            Print / PDF
          </button>
          <button id="downloadHtmlBtn" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/></svg>
            Download Log (HTML)
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Container -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6">

    <!-- Client Header Form: Input fields for Name, Date, Time, Session -->
    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/></svg>
          Client & Session Information
        </h2>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 no-print">
          <button id="setNowBtn" class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-800 bg-brand-50 hover:bg-brand-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded transition">
            Set Current Date & Time
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <!-- Name Input -->
        <div>
          <label for="clientNameInput" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Client / Participant Name <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
          </label>
          <input type="text" id="clientNameInput" placeholder="Enter your full name" 
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-brand-500 transition outline-none">
        </div>

        <!-- Date Input -->
        <div>
          <label for="logDateInput" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Date <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
          </label>
          <input type="date" id="logDateInput" 
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-brand-500 transition outline-none">
        </div>

        <!-- Time Input -->
        <div>
          <label for="logTimeInput" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Time <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
          </label>
          <input type="time" id="logTimeInput" 
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-brand-500 transition outline-none">
        </div>

        <!-- Clinician / Session Note (Optional) -->
        <div>
          <label for="clinicianInput" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
            Clinician / Session #
          </label>
          <input type="text" id="clinicianInput" placeholder="e.g. Dr. Walker / Session 2" 
                 class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-brand-500 transition outline-none">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Print View Only Header Block -->
      <div class="print-only mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-300">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div><strong>Client Name:</strong> <span id="printClientName">—</span></div>
          <div><strong>Date & Time:</strong> <span id="printDateTime">—</span></div>
          <div><strong>Clinician / Session:</strong> <span id="printClinician">—</span></div>
          <div><strong>Workbook Section:</strong> Section 1 & 2 (Stuck Point Log)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats & Progress Bar -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 no-print">
      <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Total Recorded</p>
          <p id="statTotal" class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mt-0.5">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Active / In Progress</p>
          <p id="statActive" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-700 mt-0.5">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Crossed Off / Resolved</p>
          <p id="statResolved" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-700 mt-0.5">0</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Avg Belief Drop</p>
          <p id="statBeliefChange" class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-700 mt-0.5">0%</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 17h8m0 0V9m0 8l-8-8-4 4-6-6"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Add New Stuck Point Form (Collapsible/Structured) -->
    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden no-print">
      <div class="bg-slate-50 px-5 py-3 border-b border-slate-200 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-600"></span>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider" id="formHeaderTitle">Add New Stuck Point</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Formulate as a clear 1-sentence belief</span>
      </div>

      <form id="stuckPointForm" class="p-5 space-y-4">
        <input type="hidden" id="editingId" value="">

        <!-- Stuck Point Text Input & Live Guide Tip -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <label for="spText" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Stuck Point Statement (Belief / Thought) <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <span id="cptTipBadge" class="hidden text-xs text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-200">
              💡 Tip: Frame as a belief (e.g. "Because X, I am..."), not a feeling ("I feel...").
            </span>
          </div>
          <textarea id="spText" rows="2" placeholder='e.g., "If I had paid closer attention, I could have prevented the accident."' 
                    class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-brand-500 transition outline-none"></textarea>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
            Write what you tell yourself about <em>why</em> it happened, or what it means about <em>you</em>, <em>others</em>, or the <em>world</em>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <!-- CPT Theme / Domain -->
          <div>
            <label for="spTheme" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              CPT Theme <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <select id="spTheme" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none">
              <option value="Safety">Safety (Harm / Protection)</option>
              <option value="Trust">Trust (Self & Others)</option>
              <option value="Power/Control">Power & Control (Helplessness)</option>
              <option value="Esteem">Esteem (Self-Worth / Blame)</option>
              <option value="Intimacy">Intimacy (Closeness / Isolation)</option>
              <option value="Self-Blame">Self-Blame / Hindsight</option>
              <option value="Other">Other Belief</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- Belief Category / Mechanism -->
          <div>
            <label for="spCategory" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              Type of Thinking
            </label>
            <select id="spCategory" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none">
              <option value="Assimilation">Assimilation (Self-Blame, Hindsight bias)</option>
              <option value="Over-Accommodation">Over-Accommodation (Extreme shift, "Everyone/Never")</option>
              <option value="Accommodated">Accommodated (Balanced & realistic)</option>
              <option value="Undetermined">Not yet categorized</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- Initial Belief Slider (0 - 100%) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
              <label for="spInitialBelief" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
                Initial Belief Rating
              </label>
              <span id="spInitialBeliefVal" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-700 bg-brand-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">100%</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="spInitialBelief" min="0" max="100" value="100" step="5"
                   class="w-full h-2 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-brand-600">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
              <span>0% (Don't believe)</span>
              <span>100% (Completely true)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Status -->
          <div>
            <label for="spStatus" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
              Status
            </label>
            <select id="spStatus" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 outline-none">
              <option value="Active">Active (Belief persists)</option>
              <option value="In Progress">In Progress (Examining)</option>
              <option value="Resolved">Resolved (Crossed Off!)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Accommodation / Reframing Section -->
        <div class="bg-tealbrand-50/50 p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-tealbrand-100">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <label for="spAlternative" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-tealbrand-800 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Alternative / Accommodated Thought (Balanced Reframe)
            </label>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-tealbrand-700">Developed in Session 4+ / Worksheets</span>
          </div>
          <textarea id="spAlternative" rows="2" placeholder='e.g., "I did the best I could with the limited information I had at the time; the perpetrator is 100% responsible."' 
                    class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white border border-tealbrand-200 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-tealbrand-500 transition outline-none"></textarea>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3">
            <div>
              <label for="spWorksheetUsed" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                CPT Worksheet or Session Used
              </label>
